Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.54,0:00:07.92,Main,Mukuro,0,0,0,,This is pretty difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.92,0:00:09.23,Main,Mukuro,0,0,0,,Is this right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.76,0:00:13.02,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,Yes! That should be good!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.02,0:00:15.74,Main,Mukuro,0,0,0,,Yours looks awfully big though?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.74,0:00:17.65,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,Huh? Is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.63,0:00:22.33,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Are you making snacks for Shido and the others?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.69,0:00:24.78,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.78,0:00:30.38,Main,Mukuro,0,0,0,,Mhmm. Right now, Master and the others \Nare preparing for the coming battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.38,0:00:33.44,Main,Mukuro,0,0,0,,Wracking their brains is sure \Nto make them hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.44,0:00:35.34,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,Yoshino, Natsumi, would you like \Nto make some too?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.34,0:00:36.85,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,It's fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.85,0:00:37.91,Main,Natsumi,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.91,0:00:41.44,Main,Natsumi,0,0,0,,N-No I wouldn't...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.44,0:00:42.82,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Please let us help.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.82,0:00:45.60,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,We want to be helpful to everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.99,0:00:50.06,Main,Yoshinon,0,0,0,,Yoshinon's pads spout fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.06,0:00:50.66,Main,Yoshinon,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.66,0:00:53.33,Main,Yoshinon,0,0,0,,You say a bunny doesn't have pads?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.50,0:00:57.74,Main,Yoshinon,0,0,0,,I hate clever brats like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.74,0:00:59.76,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Natsumi, you should join us, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.76,0:01:02.37,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,I'm sure it'll be fun to do together.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.72,0:01:05.87,Main,Natsumi,0,0,0,,Huh? But, u-umm...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.87,0:01:07.66,Main,Yoshinon,0,0,0,,Yes, yes, it's settled now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.66,0:01:09.38,Main,Yoshinon,0,0,0,,Hurry up and get walking.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.38,0:01:10.94,Main,Yoshinon,0,0,0,,Come on, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.52,0:02:48.50,Main,Nia,0,0,0,,From far and wide, \Nnon-erotic words that sound erotic!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.27,0:02:50.39,Main,Nia,0,0,0,,Cockle!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.66,0:02:54.02,Main,Miku,0,0,0,,Well... Bountiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.02,0:02:56.53,Main,Yuzuru,0,0,0,,Answer, sacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.53,0:02:57.45,Main,Kaguya,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.45,0:03:00.37,Main,Kaguya,0,0,0,,Uhh, umm...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.37,0:03:02.66,Main,Kaguya,0,0,0,,Machu Picchu?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.66,0:03:05.64,Main,Nia,0,0,0,,Huh? Tell us a bit more about that, Kaguya!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.64,0:03:08.02,Main,Nia,0,0,0,,How is Machu Picchu erotic?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.02,0:03:10.14,Main,Miku,0,0,0,,I want to know too!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.14,0:03:11.84,Main,Miku,0,0,0,,Please, inform us!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.84,0:03:14.29,Main,Yuzuru,0,0,0,,Demand. I seek an explanation.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.58,0:03:19.17,Main,Yuzuru,0,0,0,,What do you find sexually arousing \Nabout a ruin of the Inca Empire?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.17,0:03:23.06,Main,Kaguya,0,0,0,,Wh-Why are you only probing into my answer?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.90,0:03:29.80,Main,Kaguya,0,0,0,,Umm, because it sounds like...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.80,0:03:31.30,Main,Nia,0,0,0,,Huh? Sounds like what?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.30,0:03:33.14,Main,Miku,0,0,0,,I can't understand at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.14,0:03:36.07,Main,Yuzuru,0,0,0,,Explain. Please provide more detail.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.94,0:03:41.32,Main,Kaguya,0,0,0,,I-It sounds like the sounds a kiss makes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.58,0:03:46.33,Main,Nia,0,0,0,,That's why?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.33,0:03:49.28,Main,Miku,0,0,0,,Man, you're so cute, Kaguya-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.28,0:03:50.40,Main,Yuzuru,0,0,0,,Mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.40,0:03:52.52,Main,Yuzuru,0,0,0,,Well, you seem to genuinely mean that,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.52,0:03:54.13,Main,Yuzuru,0,0,0,,so I'll accept it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.13,0:03:56.80,Main,Kaguya,0,0,0,,What are you being so evasive about?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.80,0:03:58.58,Main,Kaguya,0,0,0,,All of you should explain yours, as well!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.58,0:04:00.59,Main,Kaguya,0,0,0,,What's erotic about "cockles"?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.59,0:04:02.42,Main,Nia,0,0,0,,Huh? It's close to co-
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.42,0:04:05.08,Main,Kaguya,0,0,0,,Ahh, could you please not explain!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.08,0:04:08.88,Main,Nia,0,0,0,,Huh? After you told us all to explain?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.88,0:04:10.10,Main,Nia,0,0,0,,Well, whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.10,0:04:11.96,Main,Nia,0,0,0,,Then let's continue.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.96,0:04:13.31,Main,Nia,0,0,0,,Chincilla.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.31,0:04:16.50,Main,Miku,0,0,0,,Uhh... "Bust".
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.50,0:04:18.61,Main,Yuzuru,0,0,0,,Answer, six.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.05,0:04:22.49,Main,Kaguya,0,0,0,,Ch-Chupacabra.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.81,0:04:25.52,Main,Nia,0,0,0,,How is that erotic?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.52,0:04:27.08,Main,Miku,0,0,0,,Please tell us!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.08,0:04:28.05,Main,Yuzuru,0,0,0,,Confusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.05,0:04:31.75,Main,Yuzuru,0,0,0,,What aspect of a blood-sucking UMA from \NSouth America brings you sexual arousal?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.75,0:04:34.78,Main,Kaguya,0,0,0,,I don't want to play with you\Nguys any more!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.78,0:04:36.70,Main,Nia,0,0,0,,Huh? Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.70,0:04:41.06,Main,Nia,0,0,0,,Then, from far and wide, \Nscenes where that boy was cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.06,0:04:41.59,Main,Kaguya,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.59,0:04:43.41,Main,Nia,0,0,0,,For me,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.41,0:04:47.96,Main,Nia,0,0,0,,I think it has to be when he refused to give up \Non kissing me even when I was nearly dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.96,0:04:50.41,Main,Nia,0,0,0,,He held me tight and went for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.41,0:04:52.00,Main,Miku,0,0,0,,For me it was that one time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.00,0:04:53.65,Main,Miku,0,0,0,,The moment he risked his own life
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.65,0:04:58.55,Main,Miku,0,0,0,,to protect me from Inverted Tohka's \Nattack in the DEM Japan Branch.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.27,0:05:01.94,Main,Miku,0,0,0,,Just remembering it reminds me how cool he was!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.30,0:05:03.45,Main,Yuzuru,0,0,0,,Proposal.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.45,0:05:07.52,Main,Yuzuru,0,0,0,,It was the time when he stopped me \Nand Kaguya from fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.52,0:05:08.80,Main,Kaguya,0,0,0,,Oh, not fair!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.80,0:05:10.62,Main,Kaguya,0,0,0,,That's the one I was about to say!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.91,0:05:16.09,Main,Nia,0,0,0,,We don't want to let that boy die, do we?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.09,0:05:17.93,Main,Miku,0,0,0,,If it weren't for Darling,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.93,0:05:22.25,Main,Miku,0,0,0,,I probably wouldn't be able \Nto trust anyone still.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.25,0:05:23.33,Main,Yuzuru,0,0,0,,Affirmative.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.33,0:05:25.00,Main,Yuzuru,0,0,0,,If not for Shido,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.00,0:05:29.14,Main,Yuzuru,0,0,0,,only Kaguya or I would exist \Nin this world, not both.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.53,0:05:33.77,Main,Nia,0,0,0,,I would definitely be dead \Nif it wasn't for that boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.15,0:05:45.03,Sign_Basic,Phone,0,0,0,,{\pos(315,190)\shad0\bord.5\3c&HFFFFFF&\be1\fay-.1\frz4.07\frx12\fry0\fax.1}Tohka\N{\fs16}Cell Phone
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.41,0:05:45.26,Main,Kaguya,0,0,0,,Hmm, Tohka?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.03,0:05:45.65,Sign_Basic,Phone,0,0,0,,{\shad0\bord0\fnArial\3c&HFFFFFF&\be1\fay-.1\frx12\fry0\fax.1\pos(318.333,213.333)\frz3.429}Call In Progress
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.57,0:05:47.88,Main - Italics,Tohka,0,0,0,,Kaguya?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.88,0:05:50.96,Main - Italics,Tohka,0,0,0,,We're making snacks for Shido \Nand the others right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.96,0:05:52.16,Main - Italics,Tohka,0,0,0,,but would you like to join us?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.56,0:05:55.42,Main - Italics,Yoshino,0,0,0,,U-Umm, Yoshino here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.42,0:05:56.65,Main - Italics,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Yuzuru,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.65,0:06:00.42,Main - Italics,Yoshino,0,0,0,,we're making snacks for Shido \Nand the others right now, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.74,0:06:01.84,Main - Italics,Mukuro,0,0,0,,Nia?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.84,0:06:03.01,Main - Italics,Mukuro,0,0,0,,It's Muku.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.01,0:06:04.30,Main - Italics,Mukuro,0,0,0,,Come lend us a hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.30,0:06:06.30,Sign_Basic,Phone,0,0,0,,{\pos(312,110)\fs20\c&HC6BFB2&\3c&HFDFAEF&\shad0}Sunday, February 18th
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.30,0:06:06.30,Sign_Basic,Phone,0,0,0,,{\pos(265.333,174)\an4\b1\bord0\shad0}Natsumi
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.30,0:06:06.30,Sign_Basic,Phone,0,0,0,,{\pos(312,300)\c&HA19E9E&\bord0\shad0}Help us make snacks
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.80,0:06:11.97,Main,Miku,0,0,0,,Ah! Natsumi, why are you the only one \Nto text instead of calling?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.97,0:06:15.07,Main,Miku,0,0,0,,Please let me hear your cute voice!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.73,0:06:20.69,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,Shizaki, how's our requests for aid \Nto each branch going?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.10,0:06:21.98,Main,Shizaki,0,0,0,,All sent.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.63,0:06:24.94,Main,Shizaki,0,0,0,,I'll report once I have replies from each.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.22,0:06:27.57,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,MARIA, have we finished \Nmaintenance on our units?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.86,0:06:30.94,Main,Maria,0,0,0,,There's essentially no issue, \Nbut if I may be greedy,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.94,0:06:34.44,Main,Maria,0,0,0,,I would like the Wizards to conduct \Na manual inspection of the basic Realizers.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.44,0:06:38.58,Main,Maria,0,0,0,,Also, I would like to request a wash \Nand wax for my outer plating.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.89,0:06:42.04,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,We'll do something about the former, \Nbut the latter is denied.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.04,0:06:44.81,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,You're going to get disgustingly filthy \Ntwo days from now anyways.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.07,0:06:49.37,Main,Maria,0,0,0,,In women, the heart is \Nthe first thing to wane, Kotori.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.37,0:06:50.59,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,What was that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.96,0:06:52.65,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Calm down, Kotori.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.45,0:06:55.25,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Why don't you take a break?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.25,0:06:57.52,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,Thanks, I'll take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.52,0:06:58.70,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.70,0:07:01.35,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,I wish there was something I could do, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.82,0:07:03.38,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.38,0:07:06.76,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,I'm going to be assigning you \Nthe toughest mission,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.76,0:07:09.24,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,so you won't have the leeway to aid others.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.59,0:07:11.11,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Toughest mission?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.50,0:07:14.11,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,Survive, no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.37,0:07:17.61,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.61,0:07:19.10,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,You're certainly right about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.85,0:07:23.02,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,Both DEM and Kurumi are targeting you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.02,0:07:25.85,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,I'm also worried about how Phantom will act.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.38,0:07:29.81,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,Especially since we don't know \NPhantom's identity
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.81,0:07:32.54,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,or what her goal behind making more Spirits is.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.54,0:07:35.45,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,I can't help getting an ominous \Nfeeling about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.26,0:07:38.39,Main,Reine,0,0,0,,Phantom's goal, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.81,0:07:42.61,Main,Reine,0,0,0,,It might be something surprisingly silly.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.61,0:07:43.40,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.93,0:07:47.16,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,Snack time!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.16,0:07:49.26,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,We made onigiri.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.27,0:07:52.28,Main,Mukuro,0,0,0,,Eat to your heart's content.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.49,0:07:54.41,Sign_Basic,Onigiri,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes New Roman\b1\fs18\c&H81817E&\3c&HF6F9F6&\shad0\frz346.6\pos(299.333,151.334)}Kotori
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.58,0:07:54.41,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,These are yours, Kotori!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.82,0:07:58.04,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,Wow. Are there different ingredients inside?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.30,0:08:00.09,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.97,0:08:03.98,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Kotori?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.98,0:08:04.92,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.42,0:08:08.92,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Cilantro?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.92,0:08:10.56,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,What is this, bullying?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.56,0:08:13.01,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,You know I hate cilantro, right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.36,0:08:17.96,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,We wanted to strengthen \Nour minds to help defeat DEM,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.96,0:08:20.77,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,so we decided to try conquering our dislikes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.77,0:08:24.52,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,Even our own onigiri are filled \Nwith things we don't like.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.23,0:08:29.42,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,My onigiri has umeboshi!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.99,0:08:33.87,Main,Mukuro,0,0,0,,Mine has pickled wasabi!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.78,0:08:37.17,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,M-Mine has celery...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.37,0:08:43.27,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,Go on!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.31,0:08:46.68,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,You should overcome this trial, too, Shido!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.68,0:08:47.39,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.25,0:08:52.76,Sign_Basic,Onigiri,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes New Roman\b1\fs18\c&H81817E&\3c&HF6F9F6&\shad0\frz346.6\pos(305.333,176.667)}Shido
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.78,0:08:52.46,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,What... is in mine?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.07,0:08:56.18,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,We really debated on your onigiri.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.18,0:08:59.73,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,After all, there aren't many foods you dislike.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.73,0:09:00.85,Main,Yuzuru,0,0,0,,Affirmative.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.85,0:09:03.77,Main,Yuzuru,0,0,0,,Yours went through careful \Nconsideration until the very end.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.71,0:09:08.81,Main,Miku,0,0,0,,Darling, if you have trouble eating it, \Nthen I'll help you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.81,0:09:11.75,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,S-So what is in mine, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.19,0:09:19.79,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,At least tell me what you put inside it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.75,0:09:28.54,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,Shido?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.15,0:09:32.39,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Tohka, what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.39,0:09:33.67,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Can't sleep?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.37,0:09:35.31,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.67,0:09:38.30,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,Miku has awful sleeping habits.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.73,0:09:41.26,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,She crawled over the floor like a caterpillar
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.26,0:09:44.50,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,and tried to sneak into my bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.89,0:09:49.35,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Was she really asleep, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.72,0:09:51.66,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,What about you, Shido?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.13,0:09:56.01,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Yeah, I was thinking about Kurumi for a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.33,0:10:00.75,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,I will... make sure to save Kurumi.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.25,0:10:02.85,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,I'll seal away her Spirit Power
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.85,0:10:05.41,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,and make her atone for her sins as best I could.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.09,0:10:07.25,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,That's what I used to think.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.46,0:10:13.99,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,But is what I consider salvation \Ntruly salvation for Kurumi?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.99,0:10:15.27,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.17,0:10:18.71,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Kurumi is trying to save her best friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.38,0:10:23.23,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Is making her give up on that \Nreally saving her?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.00,0:10:28.82,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,I have to save Kurumi, no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.63,0:10:32.33,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,But what should I be doing to achieve that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.24,0:10:35.71,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,What can I do for her?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.55,0:10:39.78,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,Can I sit next to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.18,0:10:41.91,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Yeah, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.70,0:10:45.07,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Huh? Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.98,0:10:50.89,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,They did this on the TV's {\i1}With Mother{\i0} show.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.59,0:10:54.39,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,Apparently it helps relax the mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.58,0:10:59.77,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Thank you, Tohka.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.45,0:11:03.09,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,You're always helping me so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.59,0:11:06.21,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,That's not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.69,0:11:09.81,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,I have to apologize to you, Shido.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.09,0:11:10.82,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.49,0:11:17.44,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,When I heard that you would have \Ndied if not for Kurumi,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.90,0:11:21.55,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,I felt my chest tightening up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.59,0:11:24.79,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,Then I thought to myself,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.69,0:11:30.05,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,"If I hadn't met Shido back then,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.05,0:11:33.59,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,then Shido wouldn't have to face that."
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.38,0:11:39.46,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,Even now, you wouldn't be \Nstressing yourself this much.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.03,0:11:44.97,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Tohka.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.22,0:11:48.10,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,What are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.10,0:11:52.23,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,I'm truly happy that I met you that day.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.97,0:11:54.10,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.64,0:11:56.90,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Sure I've faced danger, too,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.38,0:12:02.61,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,but I've received so much \Nfrom you and all the Spirits.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.11,0:12:08.73,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Even if I could go back to our meeting \Nwith all the memories I have now,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.73,0:12:12.19,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,I would still reach out to you \Nwithout any hesitation.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.31,0:12:14.46,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,Shido...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.45,0:12:38.27,Main,Tonomachi,0,0,0,,Good morning, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.57,0:12:40.28,Main,Tonomachi,0,0,0,,What great weather we have today, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.28,0:12:41.68,Main,Ai,0,0,0,,Morning, Tonomochi.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.68,0:12:43.61,Main,Mai,0,0,0,,Wait, it's cloudy today.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.61,0:12:46.53,Main,Ai,0,0,0,,Hey, have you heard anything from Itsuka?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.53,0:12:49.53,Main,Tonomachi,0,0,0,,No. He probably still has that cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.03,0:12:52.06,Main,Mai,0,0,0,,But it's odd, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.06,0:12:54.52,Main,Mai,0,0,0,,Tokisaki has been absent the whole time, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.52,0:12:55.88,Main,Mii,0,0,0,,That's so lame.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.88,0:12:58.17,Main,Ai,0,0,0,,So have Tohka and Tobiichi, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.57,0:13:02.67,Main,Ai,0,0,0,,You don't think they're being seduced \Nby sex-fiend Itsuka, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.67,0:13:05.42,Main,Mai,0,0,0,,Maybe all four of them \Nare on a hot springs trip!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.42,0:13:06.90,Main,Mii,0,0,0,,That's so lame.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.99,0:13:11.66,Main,Tonomachi,0,0,0,,Come on, Itsuka of all people would never—
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.66,0:13:12.81,Main,Mai,0,0,0,,Do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.31,0:13:16.05,Main,Tonomachi,0,0,0,,No, it's plenty possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.05,0:13:17.69,Main,Tonomachi,0,0,0,,I'll tell you if I find anything out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.15,0:13:20.34,Main,Both,0,0,0,,Thank you for your cooperation.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.97,0:13:23.38,Main,Tonomachi,0,0,0,,A spacequake?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.38,0:13:24.72,Main,Mai,0,0,0,,No way. Again?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.72,0:13:26.02,Main,Mii,0,0,0,,That's so lame.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.02,0:13:28.24,Main,Ai,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go to the school's shelter.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.24,0:13:29.22,Main,Mai,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.22,0:13:30.20,Main,Tonomachi,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.95,0:13:33.84,Main,Ai,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Tonomachi?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.84,0:13:37.48,Main,Tonomachi,0,0,0,,Well, did you see anything just now?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.48,0:13:38.46,Main,Mai,0,0,0,,In the sky?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.46,0:13:40.10,Main,Ai,0,0,0,,You saw something?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.10,0:13:44.71,Main,Tonomachi,0,0,0,,Hmm, it kind of looked like a battleship?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.41,0:13:49.45,Main,Ai,0,0,0,,Tonomachi, have you finally damaged your brain?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.45,0:13:53.25,Main,Mai,0,0,0,,No, he's become one of the boys \N"who can see special things".
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.25,0:13:54.47,Main,Mii,0,0,0,,That's so lame.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.99,0:13:58.65,Main,Tonomachi,0,0,0,,Could you at least say those things \Nwhere I can't hear them?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.92,0:14:05.04,Main,Tonomachi,0,0,0,,That's strange, I know-
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.04,0:14:06.19,Main,Ai,0,0,0,,Tonomachi,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.61,0:14:07.86,Main,Ai,0,0,0,,we're leaving you behind!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.17,0:14:11.24,Main,Tonomachi,0,0,0,,Ah, wait up for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.50,0:14:14.45,Main,Mikimoto,0,0,0,,The DEM fleet has emerged.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.97,0:14:17.00,Main,Nakatsugawa,0,0,0,,Their fleet numbers roughly thirty ships!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.51,0:14:20.45,Main,Kannazuki,0,0,0,,That's nearly every ship DEM possesses.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.10,0:14:23.25,Main,Kannazuki,0,0,0,,Looks like our intel was accurate.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.62,0:14:25.21,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,How's the city?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.21,0:14:27.26,Main,Kannazuki,0,0,0,,Residents have completed evacuation.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.54,0:14:29.26,Main,Kannazuki,0,0,0,,There's no one on the surface.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.74,0:14:33.01,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,Good. Now we can fight without holding back.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.74,0:14:36.52,Main - Italics,Kotori,0,0,0,,This is Fraxinus Commander, Kotori Itsuka.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.00,0:14:40.15,Main - Italics,Kotori,0,0,0,,First, I'm truly grateful \Nfor all your cooperation.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.51,0:14:44.15,Main - Italics,Kotori,0,0,0,,An insolent visitor has arrived in our city.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.50,0:14:46.61,Main - Italics,Kotori,0,0,0,,They're the lowest, \Nscummiest kind of abusive man
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.61,0:14:50.91,Main - Italics,Kotori,0,0,0,,who tries to steal the power of Spirits \Nthrough rough and violent means!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.29,0:14:54.99,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,Yeah. Hate it, right? Well beyond deplorable.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.99,0:14:59.22,Main - Italics,Kotori,0,0,0,,Men who try to dominate \Nwomen through force like that
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.22,0:15:01.89,Main - Italics,Kotori,0,0,0,,are always the kind who cowardly \Ncling to them when abandoned.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.49,0:15:06.76,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,Now! Let's teach these \Nill-mannered thugs a lesson!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.06,0:15:09.67,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,Teach them the proper way to treat women.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.67,0:15:12.17,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,Teach them how to elegantly escort a woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.17,0:15:14.77,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,Teach them how we conduct our dates!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.77,0:15:15.71,Main,All,0,0,0,,Roger!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.01,0:15:17.52,Main,All,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.78,0:15:19.64,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,What incredible fervor.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.02,0:15:22.65,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,Yeah, Kotori was cool, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.10,0:15:27.40,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,It is the commander's job \Nto raise everyone's morale.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.78,0:15:32.56,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,Though we only have six ships \Nagainst our enemy's aerial fleet of 30.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.56,0:15:35.73,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,On top of that, they have several \Nthousand Bandersnatch, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.30,0:15:40.37,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,Plus we have no idea \Nhow many Nibeelcole will pop up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.37,0:15:45.29,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,But you Spirits are the key \Nto overcoming this situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.85,0:15:50.08,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,I know it might be wrong for the leader of \Nan organization dedicated to protecting Spirits
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.08,0:15:52.30,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,to ask those very same Spirits for their help,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.69,0:15:54.02,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,but please.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.02,0:15:55.63,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,Please lend us your power.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.03,0:15:59.06,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,I ask you as the commander of Ratatoskr, no,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.36,0:16:03.81,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,I ask you as Shido's little sister, \Nplease save my older brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.50,0:16:05.56,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.11,0:16:09.33,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Please let us help, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.33,0:16:10.85,Main,Miku,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.85,0:16:14.20,Main,Miku,0,0,0,,In fact, we'd be angry \Nif you tried to leave us out!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.20,0:16:17.59,Main,Nia,0,0,0,,Raising morale is a commander's job?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.87,0:16:22.46,Main,Nia,0,0,0,,Then you're quite \Nthe commander now, little sister!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.46,0:16:26.46,Main,Kaguya,0,0,0,,Yes. Kotori is the only commander \Nwho can lead us!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.46,0:16:27.50,Main,Yuzuru,0,0,0,,Affirmative.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.50,0:16:30.84,Main,Yuzuru,0,0,0,,I'm willing to place \Nour lives in Kotori's hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.82,0:16:36.85,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,Everyone...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.82,0:16:42.81,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,Nia, it's okay to hold a strategy \Nmeeting here now, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.22,0:16:47.40,Main,Nia,0,0,0,,Yeah. I'm jamming Beelzebub.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.40,0:16:51.14,Main,Nia,0,0,0,,Even if he tries to peek at our \Nsituation now, he won't make it in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.19,0:16:54.82,Main,Nia,0,0,0,,So, what evil plots do you have?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.17,0:16:58.98,Main,Yuzuru,0,0,0,,Proposal. Why don't we use Mukuro's Michael
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.98,0:17:02.36,Main,Yuzuru,0,0,0,,to link spaces and storm \Nthe enemy's command center?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.36,0:17:05.21,Main,Kaguya,0,0,0,,Ah, I knew we were thinking the same thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.21,0:17:07.46,Main,Kaguya,0,0,0,,I just didn't say it because \Nwe couldn't speak it out loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.02,0:17:11.50,Main,Mukuro,0,0,0,,Sorry, but that might be impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.50,0:17:14.17,Main,Mukuro,0,0,0,,Ever since Master sealed away my Spirit Power,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.17,0:17:16.59,Main,Mukuro,0,0,0,,I've had difficulty \Nwith long-range teleportation.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.59,0:17:19.22,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,Even if it were possible, I wouldn't permit it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.22,0:17:21.64,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,Our enemy is naturally wary of that,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.64,0:17:24.68,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,and we have no idea \Nwhat kind of traps they've set for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.68,0:17:31.25,Main,Origami,0,0,0,,The Bandersnatch are being operated \Nby DEM's new Realizers, Ashcroft β.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.77,0:17:35.86,Main,Origami,0,0,0,,They were created using \NArtemisia Ashcroft's brain as their model.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.86,0:17:37.50,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.50,0:17:39.57,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Artemisia?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.02,0:17:42.24,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Wait, the Wizard that was with Ellen?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.24,0:17:46.00,Main,Mana,0,0,0,,She was originally the ace \Nof Britain's Anti-Spirit Team.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.00,0:17:50.41,Main,Mana,0,0,0,,DEM succeeded in integrating \Na control function into the Realizers
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.41,0:17:53.88,Main,Mana,0,0,0,,after tracing her brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.34,0:17:59.26,Main,Origami,0,0,0,,MARIA, if we captured her, \Nwould it be possible for you
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.26,0:18:02.64,Main,Origami,0,0,0,,to use her brainwave data to create \Na jamming code for the Ashcroft β?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.03,0:18:05.39,Main,Maria,0,0,0,,Yes. It would likely be possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.89,0:18:09.89,Main,Mana,0,0,0,,She was always skeptical \Nabout the way DEM does things.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.89,0:18:15.40,Main,Mana,0,0,0,,And now I think she's only obeying DEM \Nbecause they've manipulated her memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.68,0:18:17.16,Main,Origami,0,0,0,,If we push there,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.16,0:18:21.03,Main,Origami,0,0,0,,I think we have a good chance of capturing her.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.40,0:18:24.02,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,I see. Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.02,0:18:27.29,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,MARIA, you sounded like you had a strategy, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.29,0:18:28.54,Main,Maria,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.54,0:18:31.46,Main,Maria,0,0,0,,There is a way to render \Nthe Nibeelcole powerless.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.46,0:18:33.20,Main,Maria,0,0,0,,Though to do so,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.20,0:18:36.05,Main,Maria,0,0,0,,we'll need to have Shido on the front lines.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.05,0:18:37.34,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,You need Shido?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.34,0:18:39.89,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,You know I can't ever permit that!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.89,0:18:42.68,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,This battle is all about protecting Shido!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.09,0:18:43.90,Main,Maria,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.90,0:18:48.69,Main,Maria,0,0,0,,However, we cannot win if we \Ndon't do something about the Nibeelcole.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.15,0:18:51.36,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,But still...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.36,0:18:53.06,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,No, let's do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.06,0:18:54.94,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Let me hear your plan, MARIA.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.45,0:18:56.71,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,Shido...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.67,0:19:00.12,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.12,0:19:03.32,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,But before that, let's go show them
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.64,0:19:08.89,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,just what it means to fight us in this city!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.54,0:19:21.59,Main,Westcott,0,0,0,,It would seem Nightmare \Npassed along my message.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.07,0:19:26.00,Main,Ellen,0,0,0,,It looks like Ratatoskr \Nis deploying all their forces, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.00,0:19:28.02,Main,Westcott,0,0,0,,Wise decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.02,0:19:31.23,Main,Westcott,0,0,0,,They have no chance of winning \Nif they don't take the offensive here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.77,0:19:36.75,Main,Westcott,0,0,0,,They're most likely intending \Nto come after my head and yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.23,0:19:43.11,Main,Westcott,0,0,0,,It's well known that DEM \Nwould collapse if it lost us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.50,0:19:48.18,Main,Ellen,0,0,0,,In that case, Ike, \Nshouldn't you be in a safer location?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.66,0:19:52.12,Main,Westcott,0,0,0,,We started this revolution.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.44,0:19:57.17,Main,Westcott,0,0,0,,So I can't allow you to be \Nthe only one standing at its front.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.55,0:20:03.05,Main,Westcott,0,0,0,,Now, shall we begin, Captain?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.05,0:20:03.76,Main,Brennan,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.22,0:20:08.01,Main,Brennan,0,0,0,,All ships, launch the first wave \Nof Bandersnatch!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.36,0:20:20.20,Main,Brennan,0,0,0,,Magic cannons, prepare to fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.20,0:20:22.85,Main,Brennan,0,0,0,,Target Ratatoskr's aerial battleship!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.95,0:20:26.84,Main,Brennan,0,0,0,,An attack from Ratatoskr?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.84,0:20:28.78,Main,Crew,0,0,0,,It's not! This is—!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.19,0:20:45.93,Main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Attention, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.93,0:20:50.27,Main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Can you hear me, vile Wizards?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.57,0:20:51.89,Main,Ellen,0,0,0,,Nightmare!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.29,0:20:57.01,Main - Italics,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Starting now, I'm coming to hunt you all down.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.01,0:20:59.84,Main - Italics,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Do please try not to flee.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.84,0:21:00.85,Main,Ellen,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.53,0:21:07.55,Main,Brennan,0,0,0,,Ship 2, Honorius! Ship 3, Notoria! \NCover the Bandersnatch squad!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.37,0:21:13.00,Main,Brennan,0,0,0,,What?! What happened?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.00,0:21:15.29,Main,Crew,0,0,0,,It looks like we've been hit \Nwith cannons from the surface!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.29,0:21:16.86,Main,Brennan,0,0,0,,From the surface?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.06,0:21:37.18,Main,Brennan,0,0,0,,What is going on with this city?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.18,0:21:39.06,Main,Westcott,0,0,0,,Let's accept their challenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.79,0:21:43.20,Main,Westcott,0,0,0,,All we need do is remain calm
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.20,0:21:47.49,Main,Westcott,0,0,0,,and lower our fist with full force.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.08,0:21:55.00,Main,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes New Roman\b1\fs20\shad1\blur1\bord1\c&H000000&\3c&HADB0AD&\4c&HADB0AD&\pos(317.333,185.466)}Episode 2
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.08,0:21:55.00,Main,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes New Roman\an8\b1\fs20\shad1\blur1\bord1\c&H000000&\3c&HADB0AD&\4c&HADB0AD&\pos(317.866,280.399)}Final Respite
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.00,0:23:40.02,Main,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an3\fnTimes New Roman\bord1\blur3\shad1\fs16\pos(604,309.733)\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3D3D3D&\shad0\3a&H60&}Episode 3   "The Spirit's Resurrection"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.00,0:23:28.65,Main - Top,Narrator,0,0,0,,And so the battle has begun.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.09,0:23:32.34,Main - Top,Narrator,0,0,0,,What is the new combat strategy \NShido employs against Nibeelcole?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.14,0:23:35.85,Main - Top,Narrator,0,0,0,,Next Episode is Episode 3: \N"The Spirit's Resurrection."
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.14,0:23:39.27,Main - Top,Narrator,0,0,0,,The most powerful Spirit now manifests itself.
